## Final recommendation

Proceed with a TypeScript/React/Vite local-first application, IndexedDB persistence and a provider-independent domain engine. Build the configurable scanner before expanding into advanced news analysis or multiple strategies.

The first implementation priority is not a sophisticated prediction model. It is proving that the application can safely acquire reliable market data, calculate repeatable indicators, evaluate transparent scanner rules and display honest trade plans on both Windows and Android—without a user-maintained server.

Once those foundations are validated, the remaining features can be added incrementally without locking the product into a single provider or strategy.